{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026gCqVTJW0DM1795178241.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>馬鞍山富寶花園因為內部私人供水管爆裂，屋苑食水及沖廁水供應受影響。水務署已安排臨時食水供應，讓居民到場取水，水務署安排4架水車及24個水箱，亦派出供水特攻隊於取水點協助居民。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T13:24:02.231849+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":87,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T12:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T20:37:37.668087+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T13:17:21.641833+00:00","content_hash":"2a51148c23ea181d4828470a12ba13a91efce76151c19c3ab251d8b4bc76ca72","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}